<p>You telekinetically float just off the ground.</p><p>This allows you to slide around the battle quickly, increasing your movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 28%, 36%, 43%, 49%.</acronym></p><p>It also makes you more vulnerable to being pushed around (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-50%, -36%, -28%, -23%, -19%</acronym> knockback resistance).</p>